# CanIUse data (now fetched from GitHub and cached at edge - no longer bundled)

# Generated build artifacts: the og-image is a headless screenshot of the homepage,
# regenerated by every build (scripts/generate-og-screenshot.mjs) and shipped from
# .output/public, so the repo does not carry it.
public/og-image.png

# LLM infra — local only, never part of the project. Rule files, harness config,
# tool indexes and MCP servers stay out of the repo regardless of which tool
# writes them. If one slips in tracked, `git rm --cached` it and add a line here.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
*.local.md
